# This repo's own wiki lives in docs/ and IS committed on purpose: it is the
# GitHub Pages site, so index.html and manifest.js have to be in the repo even
# though writeup.py regenerates them. In a normal project you would ignore those
# two, plus .sweep-stamp and .skip-*, since they rebuild from the articles.
/docs/.sweep-stamp
/docs/.skip-*
